One page project brief for my office management web-app:

What does this problem solve?
  - Digitizes management of corporation files and documents and provides an efficient-featured search.
  - Tagging system allow files to be treated and managed differently based on the tag (Invoices, Contracts, Proposals & estimates, employees, contractors, Vehicles, Payments & Bills, etc). Currently only these tags, will add more as needed.
  - Separate department tags for more broad grouping.
  - Consolidates all traditional office department tools into one tool so that one user can manage all office tasks.
  - Central web-based dashboard with users for managers and executives to query information in lue of office-manager.
  - Reminders and priority tasks dashboard to keep track of TODO tasks and their importance.


Who is it for?
  - Currently just me for the office. As the app expands potentially will be opensourced and be monetized in future.


What are the 3-5 core features (your MVP)?
  - File management /W tagging. Stores and manages files and directories based on tags.
  - Separate databases (per department). ex, AR db, AP db, Vehicles db, HR db. 
  - Web-app dashboard, tree organized, Company->Department->Tag. Data not nested in more than (3 menus).
  - TODO/task graph with per user modifications and task assignment.
  - task and payment reminders (web-app notification with future whatsapp group bot reminders).


What is explicitly out-of-scope for V1?
  - Cloud-server hosted for online access.
  - User Accounts and multi-user modifications.
  - Notifications outside of browser.
  - Vehicle gps and insurance tracking and photo displaying.
  - Dynamic react dashboard. Simple GUI first.
  - Task assignment as user account won't be added yet.

